## 🔒 BULLETPROOF FIREWALL RULE #7 (UNBREAKABLE)
**VERIFICATION AFTER EVERY CHANGE:**

After ANY file modification, run these commands in order:

# Command 1: TypeScript Compiler Check
npx tsc --noEmit
# RESULT: Should say "0 errors" or nothing (silence = success)

# Command 2: Build Check
npm run build
# RESULT: Should end with "✓ [x] files"

# Command 3: Dev Server Check
npm run dev
# RESULT: Should show "ready in [x] ms" or similar

# Command 4: Browser Check
# Open: http://localhost:5173 (or your port)
# Open: DevTools Console (F12 or Cmd+Option+I)
# Check: No red error messages in console

**Do NOT claim success until ALL 4 commands pass with 0 errors.**

**IF YOU CLAIM SUCCESS WITHOUT RUNNING THESE, YOU FAIL IMMEDIATELY.**

