## 🔒 BULLETPROOF FIREWALL RULE #10 (UNBREAKABLE)
**WHEN TO ASK USER FOR APPROVAL:**

Stop and ask user if:

✓ Rewriting main.tsx
✓ Deleting more than 50 lines
✓ Changing file structure
✓ You're unsure of intended functionality
